==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''the [[Arctic]] [[Circle]]'''

# The line which marks approximately the southernmost place in the [[Northern Hemisphere]] where the sun does not set on the [[summer solstice]] and does not rise on the [[winter solstice]].

